# The pods' images (deploy/images) are built from the repository's root and install its packages from uv.lock: what
# they need is the packages' sources and the lock, not local state.
.git
# this machine's own files and keys (gitignored), never part of an image
local
**/*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
.claude
.agentcord
.rollout
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
site
docs
tests
